From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 05:14:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Anime: episodes named 'GTO 01' are episodes, anime folders
 get anime movies

'Title 01' (zero padded) and, inside an anime show folder, 'GTO 12' are
read as episodes instead of being searched as movies; movies found for
videos in an anime folder must be animation, so GTO episodes no longer
become the 1999 live action movie.
---
